flowchart LR
  Owner[MSME owner · mobile browser] --> UI[Mobile-first web UI]
  UI --> Advisor[Advisor API]
  Advisor --> Profile[Business profile]
  Advisor --> Rules[Deterministic catalogue rules]
  Catalog[(Product catalogue CSV)] --> Rules
  Rules --> Bundle[Eligible bundle + dependency validation]
  Bundle --> Quote[Quote and pricing service]
  Quote --> Checkout[Checkout / order API]
  UI --> Consent[Consent gate + audit]
  Consent --> Upload[Document upload endpoint]
  Upload --> OCR[Tesseract OCR worker]
  OCR --> KYC[KYC validation service]
  GST[(Mock GST registry)] --> KYC
  Udyam[(Mock Udyam registry)] --> KYC
  KYC --> Review[Auto-approve / fix / manual review]
  Review --> ESign[Mock OTP e-sign]
  ESign --> Orders[(Order state store)]
  Orders --> Tracker[Order tracker + mock notifications]
  Leads[(SMB leads CSV)] --> Model[Logistic regression propensity]
  Model --> Ops[Back-office priority queue]
  Ops --> Human[Sales / partner / field owner]
  Ops --> AssignDB[(SQLite assignments + append-only activity events)]
  Advisor -. optional future .-> LLM[LLM: conversation, translation, explanation only]
  Rules -. hard guardrail .-> Advisor
